<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Jan 24.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Jan 24.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Friday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The trial of four Mozambican policemen accused of torturing a suspected thief to death last June has ended in Maputo. The verdict will be given on January 30.</p>
<p>- Indian Ocean Cyclone Gretelle posed no immediate threat to Mozambique but could affect coastal areas from Sunday, the National Meteorological Institute said.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
